msgctxt "quest/015/ComUld002_01529:TEXT_COMULD002_01529_MIMIO_000_011:1"
msgid "I say <i>you</i>, because the only reason I deign to share this information with you is because your company needs you, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize>. We'll be damned if we're going to let a foreign power lay claim to these ruins, and so we need every able-bodied soldier we can muster on the front line."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 最前線の戦列に加わる覚悟が決まったら、<br>「ウルダハ・ランディング」で待機している、<br>「義士隊飛空兵」に申し出てほしい。
#. de: Bereite dich gut auf den Einsatz vor und melde dich dann am Landeplatz von Ul'dah beim Luftschiffsoffizier unserer Legion!
#. fr: Je ne te demande pas de prendre une décision im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment. Parle avec notre homme à l'aérodrome d'Ul'dah et écoute ses ex<shy>pli<shy>ca<shy>tions.
#. speaker: MIMIO
msgctxt "quest/015/ComUld002_01529:TEXT_COMULD002_01529_MIMIO_000_012:1"
msgid "I expect you still have questions and concerns. Very well─speak with our man at the airship landing. He will tell you everything you need to know."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>に敬礼ッ！<br>「アウトロー戦区」で行われている遺跡争奪戦について、<br>ご説明いたします！
#. de: Sei gegrüßt, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Ich wurde beauftragt, dich über deinen Einsatz an der Carteneauer Front zu instruieren.
#. fr: Salutations, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Je suis chargé de briefer les recrues potentielles sur ce qu'on attend d'elles au Front.
#. speaker: GISHITAIHIKUUHEI
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
